Value LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value Required CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_ID (.+?)
Value NEIGHBOR_NAME (.*?)
Value List SYSTEM_DESCRIPTION (.*?)
Value List MGMT_ADDRESS (\S+)

# One record per LLDP neighbour, each block after a dashed separator (campus-wan and
# vpn-fabric labs, IOS-XE 17). The system description starts on the next line and runs
# to the blank line. Capabilities, timers, media and MAC lines are not modeled.
Start
  ^-{10,}\s*$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^-{10,}\s*$$
  ^Local Intf:\s*${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s*$$
  ^Chassis id:\s*${CHASSIS_ID}\s*$$
  ^Port id:\s*${PORT_ID}\s*$$
  ^System Name:\s*${NEIGHBOR_NAME}\s*$$
  ^System Description:\s*$$ -> Description
  ^System Description:\s*${SYSTEM_DESCRIPTION}\s*$$
  ^\s+IP:\s*${MGMT_ADDRESS}\s*$$
  ^Total entries displayed:\s*\d+\s*$$
  ^[A-Za-z][\w .()/-]*?(:|\s-)(\s.*)?$$
  ^\s+\S.*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized show lldp neighbors detail line"

Description
  ^\s*$$ -> Start
  ^${SYSTEM_DESCRIPTION}\s*$$
